      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "observed.dispatch_sink_read_pos_exceeds_iseq_capacity",
      "fine_trace_step": 10,
      "description": "A later `dispatch()` iteration reads the next 16-bit jump-link field from an out-of-range `pos0`, so `PEEK_S` dereferences past the allocated bytecode buffer `s->iseq`. Stage 01 ASan reports the crash here as a 1-byte heap-buffer-overflow read."
    },
